cmudict.gz is made from the Carnegie Mellon Pronouncing Dictionary (CMUdict), as PyPI's cmudict
package 1.1.3 ships it (data/cmudict.dict, sha256 81917843c7f44ce2b094ac63873c2c7a4cf802040792c455ba3ca406891c3d22),
by incantations.build_dictionary: each word's first pronunciation, stress marks removed, keys
normalised. https://github.com/cmusphinx/cmudict

Its licence and README, as they are:

